> 提取的原语：
> - 操作类：射线延伸(ray_extend), 重涂色(recolor), 外推(extrapolate), 计数(counting), 对角线编码(diagonal_encoding), 对接(dock), 压缩(compress), 对齐(align), 擦除(erase), 印章覆盖(stamp), 重力下落(gravity_drop), 填充(fill), 推断(infer), 溢出扩散(overflow_spread), 搜索(search), 滑动(sliding), 螺旋绘制(spiral_draw), 裁剪(clip), 形状匹配(shape_match), 平移(translate), 连线(draw_line), 排序(sort)
> - 对象类：种子像素(seed_pixel), 条纹(stripe), 等距标记点(equally_spaced_markers), 算术线(arithmetic_line), 完整方块(full_square_block), 输出网格(output_grid), 对角线单元(diagonal_cell), 内部槽位(interior_socket), 可移动组件(movable_component), 结构体(structure), 色带(color_stripe), 精灵体(sprite), 锚点像素(anchor_pixel), 封闭区域(enclosed_region), 边界图例(border_legend), 可移动像素(movable_pixel), 可动对象(movable_object), 障碍物(obstacle), 矩形(rectangle), 三连块(triomino), 缺角(missing_corner), 整幅画布(full_canvas), 格子框架(lattice_frame), 格子槽位(lattice_slot), 水源(water_source), 架子(shelf), 空心矩形区域(empty_rect_region), 背景空间(background_space), 前景对象(foreground_object), 障碍像素(blocker_pixel), 原型对象(prototype_object), 候选对象(candidate_object), 晶格网格(lattice_grid), 标记块(marker_block), 边框方块(bordered_square), 网格边缘(grid_edge), 分隔行(divider_row)
> - 空间关系类：等距共线(equally_spaced_collinear), 射线方向推断(ray_inferred_direction), 条带方向(stripe_orient), 共享归一掩码(shared_norm_mask), 颜色关联区域(color_links_to_region), 邻接阻挡(adjacency_blocking), 间隙对半分(gap_bisect), 对角偏移(diagonal_offset), 跨框架对应(cross_frame_match), 级联分支(cascading_branch), 旋转反射等价(rotation_reflection_eq), 标记行列选择(marker_row_column_selection), 颜色决定目标(color_determines_destination), 穿透与停靠(pass_through_or_stop)
> - 条件/判断类：种子色决定延伸(seed_color_determines_extend), 边界内延续(continue_within_bounds), 完整方块过滤(full_square_filter), 忽略干扰项(ignore_distractors), 轨迹涂黑(trail_painted_black), 连续重复折叠(dup_collapsed), 对齐到锚点(aligned_to_anchor), 碰撞停止(collision_stop), 编码映射(encoding_map), 缓冲行间距(cushion_row_gap), 奇数间隙留中线(odd_gap_midline), 源色决定方向(source_color_decides), 槽位位置决定颜色(slot_position_color), 最大矩形填充(largest_rect_filled), 最小边长约束(min_side_constraint), 固定步长平移(fixed_step_translate), 遇障碍停止(stop_at_blocker), 递增步长(increasing_step), 游程压缩后比较(run_length_compare), 行列带穿越标记(row_column_band_through_marker), 行重叠内移(row_overlap_shifts_inward), 距离优先排序(distance_priority_ordering), 宽度决定行为(width_determines_behavior), 色数映射线型(count_maps_line)
>
> 设计原则：每题至少 2 个原语紧耦合；推理骨架互不相同。

